Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.47,0:00:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said，「Look，lady，the seats haven't gotten smaller，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.80,0:01:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,your ass has gotten bigger.「
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.81,0:01:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，sir。This cabin is restricted to first class.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.86,0:01:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you looking for this？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.69,0:01:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I get you anything？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.99,0:01:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scotch。Blended。Straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.87,0:02:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is your captain speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.70,0:02:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've got a report of some turbulence ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.87,0:02:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please return to your seats and fasten your seat belts…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,and remain there until we release the fasten-seat-belt sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.39,0:02:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hear birds can't fly this high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.73,0:02:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hear only angels can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's the bomb？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.41,0:02:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am the bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.04,0:02:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shall I pour your Scotch？-No，I'll take the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Another movie from an old TV show.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.93,0:03:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Walk out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.23,0:03:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.44,0:03:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.94,0:03:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing？！Get off of me！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me！Help me！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me！Be careful！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice flight？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.41,0:04:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,You crazy bastard！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.29,0:05:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you mean 「crazy bitch.」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is this？What's going on here？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.47,0:05:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn，I hate to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,No way！No way！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.14,0:05:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's with that？！Who are you people？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who are you people？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.65,0:05:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Once upon a time，there were three very different little girls
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,who grew up to be three very different women.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Making her a five-day champion。Way to go，Natalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.03,0:06:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,They have three things in common：They're brilliant，beautiful…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to be all over you！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.61,0:06:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will be kissing my ass…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,and they work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name is Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's go this way。-No！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,This way！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.56,0:06:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait。I'm not a yo-yo！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning，Starfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning，Chad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.60,0:07:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sweet Chad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I figured we could have a little breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then，maybe，after，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.27,0:07:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,we could have a little Chad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.03,0:07:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold that thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I'll be right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't that just the luck？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.46,0:07:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can make something besides eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，it's not the eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it the boat？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.97,0:07:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not the boat。I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.14,0:08:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it the Chad？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,It might be the Chad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.82,0:08:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the Chad… the Chad！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eduardo，move me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.58,0:09:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know I signed the waiver，so feel free to stick things in my slot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.25,0:09:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.84,0:09:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:09:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！I'll be right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to get one thing straight between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.93,0:10:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go ahead。We're past keeping secrets at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is going to be long…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,hard and rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sometimes when it's rough，I just get there faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you don't defuse this bomb，L.A。will be an underwater attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which wire？The red one or the blue one？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.04,0:10:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.38,0:10:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,My muffins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is stupid，anyway。Why wouldn't I just yank the wire？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.55,0:10:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're dummy wires，honey。The real mechanism is inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trip the external feedback circuit，the bomb will detonate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.39,0:10:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,For a bikini waxer，you know a lot about bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.07,0:11:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't it amazing how much information you can learn off the Internet？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,When do I get to meet this Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.59,0:11:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie's not a very social person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.59,0:11:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,But Charlie's a chick though，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，definitely a woman，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't keep up this fa？ade with Jason anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.27,0:11:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who wants a man who's intimidated by a strong woman？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,They come on nice until they find out I can shatter a block with my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love that trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blueberry muffins.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.95,0:11:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I made them from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,These look great，Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.46,0:11:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.39,0:12:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's this？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chinese fighting muffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing to laugh about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.73,0:12:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,My buddy took a fighting muffin in the chest，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,went home in four Ziploc bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.49,0:12:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're not Chinese。They're not fighting。They're blueberry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's having secret-identity trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.83,0:12:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aren't we all？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alex…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,all my Angels…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,the heart is a muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.51,0:12:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,In bodybuilding，we exercise the muscle
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.22,0:12:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,and it grows bigger and stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the same with the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I must have the heart of a rhino.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do。And you'll be proud of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.69,0:13:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mes Anges…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,these little hurts will heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.53,0:13:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,And at crunch time，your hearts will be so buff…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.03,0:13:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,you'll be able to clean and jerk his love…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.37,0:13:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,three sets，10 reps each.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.21,0:13:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，Bos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me。I have to take a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.39,0:13:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning，Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.05,0:13:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning，Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.64,0:13:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dylan，Alex，Natalie，I hope you're ready for your next assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Meet Eric Knox，a brilliant engineer and founder of Knox Technologies
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,an up-and-coming communications software company.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.40,0:13:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Last night，Knox was kidnapped
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.82,0:13:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,and his voice-identification software was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's the lady left behind？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.42,0:14:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vivian Wood，she is the president of Knox Technologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，she did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess we can all go home then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angels，meet Vivian Wood，our new client.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's hired us to find Eric Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ms。Wood，Who'd have the most to gain from Knox's disappearance？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me，probably。I'm his partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.44,0:14:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Before we were partners
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.27,0:14:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,we were friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Does Knox have any enemies？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.78,0:14:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roger Corwin。He's owner
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.03,0:14:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,of Red Star，the largest communications satellite firm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Six months ago，he tried to buy Knox Technologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,When Knox refused to sell，Corwin lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was there a ransom demand？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing。But I know he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll study the garage footage。Something may be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.14,0:14:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,So Corwin is our only lead。Hopefully，he'll take us to Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:15:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Corwin gets a weekly massage at Madame Wong's House of Blossoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.31,0:15:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's our chance to feel him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.98,0:15:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,He said what？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.15,0:15:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Over my dead body」？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can accept those terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.49,0:15:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's getting a little chilly in here，Yoko。I could use some warming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,At your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could we get started this millennium？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.68,0:15:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Banzai！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.14,0:15:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're holding a lot of tension…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,in your 4th and 5th vertebrae.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.61,0:15:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.86,0:15:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me see if I can work that…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just by activating the right energy points，you can increase circulation…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,alleviate pain…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,or even…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,render a man unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.73,0:16:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.07,0:16:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Palm Pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.45,0:16:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got the car key.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.79,0:16:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got his schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:17:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must have dozed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're very good
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,with your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.77,0:17:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could use someone like you on my staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.11,0:17:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks for the offer，but my hands aren't going anywhere near your staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,If Corwin is behind Knox's disappearance
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.45,0:17:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,someone else is doing his dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.80,0:17:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,How's it coming with the kidnapping footage？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm enhancing a reflection from the car window.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,May I take your order？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.98,0:17:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three cheeseburgers，three french fries and three cherry pies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you guys want？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here's one of the kidnappers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:17:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Creepy Thin Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now we just look for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.66,0:18:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,And see if he works for Corwin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.66,0:18:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's Corwin doing tonight？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's up for crashing a party？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.69,0:18:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks，Nat。-No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.69,0:18:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a mic-transmitter。Put it on your back molar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know。It's a mouth-mic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll be able to always stay in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're in deep cover now，so if…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,you can't remember John David，just call me J.D.Think of…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:19:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jelly doughnut。-Jack Daniel's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.38,0:19:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Juvenile delinquents。-John DeLorean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.64,0:19:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's your date，J.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.07,0:19:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roger Corwin。Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.07,0:19:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,John David Rage，self-help guru.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,John David Rage？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.33,0:19:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Relax，Bos。Order a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.58,0:19:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me。Miss？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi。-Hi，miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A hammerhead，please。-No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.67,0:19:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any creepy thin men？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.09,0:19:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lots of creepy，none thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I was wondering if… - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So there's no chance… - No。No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.61,0:19:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.28,0:19:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.03,0:20:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.07,0:20:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,This place，it's Japanese，is it not？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.33,0:20:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a 13th-century Shinto temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.42,0:20:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had it…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.50,0:20:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had it FedEx'd from Kyoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.34,0:20:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blowfish？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.92,0:20:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't that poisonous？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.51,0:20:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a rare delicacy for the man who has no fear of an excruciating death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.51,0:20:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Technically，1 in 60 is fatal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.03,0:20:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tastes like chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.86,0:20:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,That would go very nicely with broccoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.53,0:20:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,The man laughs at death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good work，Bos。Get him to talk about Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.41,0:20:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,At last，a worthy adversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.88,0:21:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,But let's see if you can survive a test of intuition and judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nat，that bartender is cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.93,0:21:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm working.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.52,0:21:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,He likes you。Go back and flirt a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.19,0:21:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.69,0:21:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not called Balls-Out Natalie for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.70,0:21:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.03,0:21:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never saw you working here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.03,0:21:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm new。I'm like a virgin。I mean，it's my first time
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,here at Corwin's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.21,0:21:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，boy。She's going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.21,0:21:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,No way。He's into her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.38,0:21:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just pick up the tray and walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.72,0:21:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no。Stay。Stay and talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.72,0:21:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Flip your hair。-What？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.97,0:21:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Flip your goddamn hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.07,0:22:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，I'm sorry。I don't usually do this，but I was wondering…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.25,0:22:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,unless you're already seeing someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.25,0:22:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。-Of course you are，sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.46,0:22:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！I'm not seeing anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.50,0:22:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Free.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.26,0:22:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Thursday？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.18,0:22:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,My favorite day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.59,0:22:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great。I'll get tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.51,0:22:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.93,0:22:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you know？A guy who speaks Natalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.73,0:22:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's J.D.？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.80,0:23:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will somebody help me up，please？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.01,0:23:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，girls？Are you hearing me？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.81,0:23:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thin Man，10 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.85,0:24:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do they always run？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.97,0:24:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch it！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.74,0:24:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nat！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.46,0:25:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Brace！-Jump！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.24,0:27:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check them all！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.71,0:27:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Clear！-Clear！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.08,0:27:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clear！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.07,0:27:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.57,0:27:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great work，Angels，but our job's only half-finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.91,0:27:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's still the matter of Mr.Knox's stolen technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.12,0:27:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's so special about your software？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.58,0:27:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's really…It's really quite amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.25,0:28:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,We developed a program。You see，everyone's voice is unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.93,0:28:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,It has a unique signature…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.93,0:28:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,like a snowflake。And it can be mapped…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.10,0:28:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's audio DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.77,0:28:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,It makes it impossible to disguise or scramble a voice signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.60,0:28:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which is why Corwin wants it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.81,0:28:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course。All Red Star's satellites have global positioning systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.99,0:28:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Combine that with voice identification.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.78,0:28:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any cell phone could be a homing device.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.78,0:28:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one could hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.45,0:28:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Imagine how dangerous this would be in the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.16,0:28:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,The end of privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.46,0:28:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's where you come in，Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.75,0:28:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Corwin is premiering his Red Star racer at the California Speedway.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.63,0:28:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our chance to plant a hidden camera on Corwin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.93,0:28:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like it's off to the races，Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.93,0:28:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,When Roger Corwin first got involved in the world of racing…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.27,0:28:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,a lot of people said it was a stopgap for my waning libido.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.44,0:28:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had them all fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.23,0:29:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's so funny？I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.45,0:29:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming to this little test run.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.50,0:29:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nat…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.67,0:29:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.34,0:29:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,But what can I say？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.17,0:29:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a Red Star day for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.30,0:29:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then it's back to the day-to-day grind…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.89,0:29:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,of world domination and enslavement.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.48,0:29:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.37,0:29:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Work your magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.83,0:29:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's hot out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.17,0:30:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's hot in here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.88,0:30:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe I can make you more comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.61,0:30:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've come undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.86,0:30:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,That feels good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.15,0:30:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.04,0:30:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like what you've done with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.54,0:30:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ours has bigger mirrors.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.88,0:30:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.26,0:30:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you like fast cars？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.73,0:31:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like fast everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.23,0:31:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.95,0:31:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.57,0:31:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.96,0:31:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.35,0:31:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tomorrow morning Corwin will give us a tour of Red Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.92,0:31:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ride'em，cowboy。Make me proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.34,0:32:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nat！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.63,0:32:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.01,0:32:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got a friend on the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.05,0:32:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,That creep from Chinatown.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.84,0:32:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Creepy Thin Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.52,0:32:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a round track。He's not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.26,0:32:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's going after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.72,0:34:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,The microcamera has allowed us to study Red Star's layout.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.14,0:34:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,The mainframe is right behind that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.31,0:34:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's where my software would be but the security looks incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.15,0:34:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Restricted access。-Fingerprint ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.99,0:34:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Retinal scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.49,0:34:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angels，break it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.82,0:34:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only two Red Star directors can access the mainframe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.99,0:34:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,To get throught the security system，they have to synchronize their entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.67,0:34:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,A gelatin scanning plate takes exact fingerprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.67,0:34:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,A laser accurate to .009 millimeters scans the retina.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.51,0:35:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is accessible only through a monitored airless antechamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.98,0:35:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's only one way to get through undetected：Be invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.03,0:35:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,The floor is rigged with pressure sensitivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.57,0:35:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any contact exceeding .25 seconds triggers the alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.75,0:35:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sounds impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.04,0:35:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.28,0:36:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mein Siegenbock ist sexy！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.46,0:36:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,They got the wrong address.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.83,0:37:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ready to whip them into shape，Alex？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.84,0:37:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must be Miss Aarons。I'm Doris.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.68,0:37:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry about the confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.22,0:37:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had you scheduled for next week。I don't know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.27,0:38:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I'm here to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.52,0:38:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are the efficiency expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.69,0:38:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.69,0:38:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.11,0:38:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.53,0:38:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.71,0:38:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your methodologies are antiquated and weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.88,0:38:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your procedures of approval ensure that only the least radical ideas…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.05,0:38:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,are rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.72,0:38:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Meanwhile，your competition is innovating！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.06,0:38:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.73,0:38:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was the last suggestion you made？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.78,0:38:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,To make the Coke machine free.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.99,0:38:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.41,0:38:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Caffeine helps us program.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.75,0:38:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perfect，smart…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.58,0:39:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,simple and logical.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.92,0:39:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did your boss say？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.09,0:39:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,He said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.59,0:39:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Question！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.34,0:39:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who builds this company's products？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.60,0:39:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.10,0:39:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Engineers do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not managers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.94,0:39:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,They should be answering to you，not you to them！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.45,0:39:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who else has an idea like this man's Coke machine？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.28,0:39:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right！Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.20,0:39:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Better yet…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.46,0:39:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,can anyone show me？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.64,0:40:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.84,0:41:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's only one way to get through undetected：Be invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.57,0:41:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,The floor is rigged with pressure sensitivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.23,0:41:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any contact which exceeds .25 seconds will trigger the alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.43,0:41:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.94,0:42:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope you don't mind if we look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.64,0:42:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,So we have complete access to Red Star's computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.98,0:42:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,And they have no idea we can peek inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.94,0:42:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,You guys are tremendous。Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.65,0:42:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need evidence of Knox Technologies software in the Red Star system.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.78,0:43:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where is it？-Bosley has it in the laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.37,0:43:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,It has a direct link to the Red Star mainframe.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.62,0:43:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bosley？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.83,0:43:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe we should be doing our own analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.17,0:43:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Surely Eric would be the best person to…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.67,0:43:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our goal was to learn if Red Star had stolen your software.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.72,0:43:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,It would be unethical to let you access their systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.18,0:43:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we get proof，we'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.47,0:43:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,That makes sense。That's cool。Right？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.68,0:43:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，Viv？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.85,0:43:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，Knox may not be out of danger yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.98,0:43:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Smile。Don't panic the client.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.15,0:43:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,One of us should check security at his house.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.53,0:43:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Absolutely。I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.04,0:43:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Everything all right？-Yeah。Nothing up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.54,0:43:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wow，that was cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.72,0:44:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's that Green Beret？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.05,0:44:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,My dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.55,0:44:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.06,0:44:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the guy who killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.56,0:44:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。They were in Army Intelligence together.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.52,0:44:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,This was his best friend and he turned on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.90,0:44:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.74,0:44:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.74,0:44:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do you keep it？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.58,0:44:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,To remind me：Be careful who you trust。Don't take any wooden nickels.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.42,0:44:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about you？Did you ever have parents？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.75,0:44:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean… I know you have parents，but I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.26,0:44:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's your mom？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.59,0:44:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,She died when I was 6，and I never met my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.26,0:44:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,You never met your father？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.27,0:44:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now you work for…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.44,0:44:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,a man you've never seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.44,0:44:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's an interesting trend.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.11,0:45:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.78,0:45:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Want to play Scrabble？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.45,0:45:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it。I got somebody…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.45,0:45:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.45,0:45:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are they called？You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.63,0:45:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.47,0:45:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This is a panic button。-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.14,0:45:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you just press it，then any one of us…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.93,0:45:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,whoever's closest，will be here if there's any problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.94,0:45:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like that？Okay。Right now，that would be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.48,0:45:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,But you don't have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.82,0:45:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，l do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.16,0:45:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.66,0:45:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,how to make chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.50,0:45:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scrabble？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.96,0:45:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shake'N Bake？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.33,0:45:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll shake，you bake？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.85,0:46:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.52,0:46:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，Pete。-How's it going？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.48,0:46:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good。How are you？-Good。It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.53,0:46:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You want your ticket？-All right！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.37,0:46:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks for giving me a chance。-I wanted to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.70,0:46:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Really？-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.37,0:46:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You look great。-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.83,0:46:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've thought a lot about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.88,0:46:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，no。I know you have something to say
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.42,0:46:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I have something to say too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.05,0:46:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been thinking a lot about you and me and，well，us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.22,0:46:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I know that we have these crazy lives，but I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.22,0:46:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.06,0:47:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Searching Red Star mainframe for Knox Technologies software.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.40,0:47:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Software not detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.24,0:47:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.91,0:47:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.12,0:47:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trick-or-treat for UNlCEF.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.92,0:47:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a very nice costume，young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.76,0:47:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,It glows in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.51,0:47:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope you like to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.89,0:47:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you kidding？I love to dance！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.11,0:47:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want to dance on-stage？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.57,0:47:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Us？-Yes！-No，the stage is for the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.28,0:47:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，never mind。I'll just find a spot on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.62,0:47:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.28,0:47:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Soul Train's highest honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.79,0:48:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I won't let you not go up there。Yeah，she'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.12,0:48:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？I've always wanted to go up there！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.29,0:48:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.96,0:48:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.63,0:48:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ms。Wood，there are some lines that I never cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.97,0:48:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lines have never stopped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.31,0:48:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's 「Miss.」 And it's 「Vivian.」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.81,0:48:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Miss Vivian.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.31,0:48:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Miss Vivian。You're a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.15,0:48:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，you're not a pro，but you're an executive.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.49,0:48:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,We must keep our relationship professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.66,0:48:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,May I？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.16,0:48:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll get you a glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.70,0:49:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's pretty great，isn't she？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.05,0:49:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said，she's pretty great，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.56,0:49:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You guys are in really good shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.23,0:49:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Definitely。Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.45,0:49:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。The Robot！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.74,0:50:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，white girl！Go，white girl！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.54,0:50:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's old school，right？Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.25,0:50:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Pete。How are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.76,0:50:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Running Man！Look！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.93,0:50:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Incredible！It was great！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.39,0:50:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm having so much fun！This is so exciting！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.61,0:50:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I have to go number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.90,0:50:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.45,0:50:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,what I'm trying to say is…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.79,0:50:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,will you marry me？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.29,0:50:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no，baby！Baby？！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.29,0:50:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Baby？！God，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.46,0:50:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn you，Salazar.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.97,0:50:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn you，Salazar！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.47,0:51:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cut！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.10,0:51:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was that over the top？It felt over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.81,0:51:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。That is the best shot，the best scene，the best movie on the planet！
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.65,0:51:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.41,0:51:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,How was your day？Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.49,0:51:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know how superheroes have these secret identities，where they…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.66,0:51:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。No superheroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.50,0:51:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're an action star.I get a lot of action.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.51,0:51:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.59,0:51:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，girls，you having fun？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.51,0:51:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm having so much fun I could just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.85,0:51:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jason，I'm one-third of an elite crime-fighting team…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.60,0:51:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,backed by an anonymous millionaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.19,0:51:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.37,0:52:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.47,0:52:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.84,0:53:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Go！Hit it！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.93,0:53:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Murphy O'Meyer…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.60,0:53:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,that does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.19,0:53:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who sent you？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.61,0:53:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who？！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.78,0:53:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Woo… Woo…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.78,0:53:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Who？-Woo…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.12,0:53:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Vivian。-Spit it out！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.12,0:53:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vivian Wood！
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.63,0:53:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,You bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.30,0:53:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.29,0:54:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.33,0:54:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God！You're hit！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.33,0:54:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I mean，the squibs hurt a bit when they go off，but I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.67,0:54:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened to my trailer？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.00,0:54:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I haven't been honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.92,0:54:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Were you in there when that happened？Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.34,0:54:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not a bikini waxer.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.18,0:54:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bummer。I mean，that was kind of a turn-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.95,0:54:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.53,0:54:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Charlie？-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.03,0:54:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to go，but will you call me tomorrow？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.12,0:54:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Of course。-Great。Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.34,0:55:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.21,0:55:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.89,0:55:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guys，finally you warm up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.89,0:55:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dylan？It's Nat。Vivian Wood is a fake and an all-around bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.56,0:55:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her assassin just paid me a visit。We gotta warn Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.40,0:55:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm at his house now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.40,0:55:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.65,0:55:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.24,0:55:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Call Alex and meet me at the agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.74,0:55:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dylan！Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.58,0:55:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't stand next to the window，it's not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.26,0:55:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Toga.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.76,0:55:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，I just found out that… Who's that？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.10,0:55:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Working undercover？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.27,0:56:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a full-service job.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.44,0:56:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.27,0:56:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can see by your gown that you're unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.94,0:56:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some maniac could just stroll in and blow you both to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.87,0:56:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Viv，you're obsessed。All work and no play makes Viv a dull girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.12,0:56:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to tie up some loose ends here，so take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.54,0:56:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Want some champagne？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.13,0:56:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Enemy.」
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.14,0:56:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.15,0:56:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.32,0:56:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your girlfriends are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.32,0:56:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Corwin？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.60,0:57:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think it's gonna work out，you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.68,0:57:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which is a real bummer，since you，Dylan…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.19,0:57:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,are a tomcat in the sack.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.36,0:57:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me get this straight。You're a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.25,0:57:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Women have natural intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.11,0:57:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you're a detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.26,0:57:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you had no idea that this was going to happen？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.87,0:57:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I knew。-She knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.20,0:57:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I know what'll happen next.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.29,0:57:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell her，baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.88,0:57:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,All the Angels are going to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.38,0:57:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Bosley？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.80,0:57:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll keep him。We like him。And his computer too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.80,0:57:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's special.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.47,0:58:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Corwin had nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.72,0:58:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。But I never really liked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.06,0:58:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And the kidnapping was a setup。-Afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.23,0:58:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Red Star was a setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.98,0:58:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got it all figured out。Any other questions？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.90,0:58:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.24,0:58:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ask your boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.74,0:58:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.91,0:58:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're after Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.83,0:58:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie，Charlie，Charlie，Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.42,0:58:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,They say that in death…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.30,0:58:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,all life's questions are answered.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.26,0:58:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you let me know？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.19,0:58:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go get Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.77,0:58:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.87,0:59:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.04,0:59:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's going on？-Something's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.13,0:59:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's Dylan？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.14,0:59:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,They say in death，all life's questions are answered.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.81,0:59:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you let me know？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.01,1:00:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are we doing？House of Pancakes？Sizzler？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.18,1:00:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are the cheapest man on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.70,1:00:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What did it look like？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.53,1:00:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I don't know。It was，like，all cool and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.96,1:00:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've never seen a booby.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.62,1:00:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Have too。-Have not.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.21,1:00:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I've seen lots of boobies。-Yeah，right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.05,1:00:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,A little help？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.15,1:00:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.57,1:00:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's Knox？Is he okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.90,1:01:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，he's great。He's the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.57,1:01:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,The kidnapping was a setup。He's behind it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.83,1:01:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？Why？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.74,1:01:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,He wasn't exactly forthcoming when he shot me out the window.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.34,1:01:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bosley！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.76,1:01:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's safe！Knox already has him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.43,1:01:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.60,1:01:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.61,1:01:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bosley's with the man…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.77,1:01:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,who tried to kill us。That's safe？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.11,1:01:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,He won't kill Bosley until he kills Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.11,1:01:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kills Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.12,1:01:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.79,1:01:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what his plan is，but I know that we can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.88,1:02:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,If Knox thinks we're dead，why blow up the agency？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.51,1:02:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why does he want Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.89,1:02:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,We do know that he wanted us to break into Red Star.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.14,1:02:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Imagine how dangerous this would be in the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.73,1:02:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Knox used us to access the mainframe not to get back his software
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.15,1:02:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,but for control of their global positioning satellites.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.07,1:02:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Knox's software can match Charlie's voice over the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.16,1:02:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,And use Red Star satellites to track him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.08,1:02:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,But why would Knox go to so much trouble to find Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.67,1:02:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the guy who killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.17,1:02:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,They were in Army Intelligence together.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.92,1:02:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,His best friend turned on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.59,1:02:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Knox thinks Charlie killed his father.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.85,1:02:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,So if he can intercept Charlie's call…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.68,1:02:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,He can locate him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.43,1:02:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,But Knox has to get Charlie on the phone first.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.85,1:03:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But the only one Charlie calls is… - Bosley.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.72,1:03:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,May I have some ice water，please？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.24,1:03:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fly to me，Angels！Please come！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.25,1:03:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please fly to me，Angels！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.08,1:04:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had a long talk with a squirrel once.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.67,1:04:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Longer than I've talked to most humans.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.28,1:04:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？Hello？Hello out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.95,1:04:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any sign of Bosley's laptop？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.79,1:04:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,They must have taken it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.46,1:04:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We should check Knox's place。-Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.21,1:04:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.46,1:04:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angels？！Angels，help me！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.96,1:04:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bosley？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.30,1:04:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angels！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.88,1:04:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,We begin our broadcast day！Come and get me，girls！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.64,1:04:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you can follow the sound of my voice，
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.31,1:05:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,then draw some triangles or something
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.14,1:05:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,to get to this location and save me！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.23,1:05:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there a way to trace him？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.65,1:05:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even with our equipment，he'd have to be within 20 miles.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.99,1:05:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,The place I'm in looks like Cher's bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.32,1:05:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it stinks.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.16,1:05:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell us where you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.16,1:05:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It smells like the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.16,1:05:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if I look out the window，I see the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.75,1:05:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,He could be anywhere this half of North America.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.50,1:05:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jack…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.17,1:05:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,tell them where I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.68,1:05:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.76,1:05:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a Sitta pygmaea！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.85,1:05:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,A pygmy nuthatch！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.52,1:05:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,They only live in one place！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.52,1:05:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Carmel！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.11,1:05:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't tell you anything else，except…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.19,1:05:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,this feels like the first day of the last of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.20,1:05:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or the last day of the first of my life，or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.20,1:06:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a lighthouse，two hotels，seven manor houses…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.54,1:06:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,one owned by the National Parks，one by Nick Xero Corporation…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.88,1:06:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is that spelled with an 「X」 or a 「Z」？-「X.」
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.38,1:06:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's an anagram.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.26,1:06:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rearranged，it's 「Eric Knox.」
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.55,1:06:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scrabble freak.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.30,1:06:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,An old tunnel leads down to the shore.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.89,1:06:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,A sea approach is the best way to get in undetected。We'll need a boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.39,1:06:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,And a cover。We can't use the speedboat.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.07,1:06:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Head to the marina.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.46,1:07:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chad，does this thing go any faster？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.63,1:07:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're in a hurry，and I could open it up if you let me drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.63,1:07:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，friend of Starfish。There's only one captain of this love boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.47,1:07:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,That captain is me…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.81,1:07:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,the Chad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.81,1:07:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Chad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.48,1:07:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chad，captain of the love boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.56,1:07:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Chad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.81,1:07:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're kind of in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.98,1:07:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm the Chad.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.42,1:08:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Knox Technologies voice identification software download confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.51,1:08:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red Star satellite network uplink confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.69,1:08:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Revenge is fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.16,1:08:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to say，Starfish，I am honored…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.87,1:08:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,honored that you've taken an interest in my work.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.14,1:08:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I think you're very pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.04,1:08:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Starfish？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.04,1:08:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you going？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.88,1:08:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Starfish，are you going swimming？Where are you going？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.42,1:08:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you going again？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.13,1:09:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Starfish？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.80,1:09:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Was it the Chad？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.89,1:09:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！The Chad was great！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.77,1:09:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Chad was great.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.73,1:09:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll tap the signal from the roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.15,1:10:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll deal with Knox。-I'll bring our Bosley back.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.80,1:10:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,「I don't know how to make chicken.」
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.34,1:10:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jerk.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.01,1:11:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dylan.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.51,1:11:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank God you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.30,1:11:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know my better half.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.60,1:11:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,It figures I'd meet the perfect guy and he'd already have a perfect girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.59,1:11:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，blondie.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.59,1:11:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her girlfriend's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.43,1:11:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jimmy，Paulie，go secure Bosley，would you？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.26,1:11:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Like now，now，now，now.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.44,1:12:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bos？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.27,1:12:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bosley？-Natalie？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.11,1:12:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Natalie，is that you？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.32,1:12:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Behind this door.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.78,1:12:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bosley，I'm so happy to see you！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.62,1:12:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're all here。I'll get you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.30,1:12:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red wire.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.30,1:12:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blue wire.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.30,1:12:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,GPS phone tap.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.47,1:12:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pygmy nuthatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.31,1:12:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm getting tickled。-Who's calling now？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.94,1:12:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's Pete！-Pete？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.82,1:12:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.48,1:12:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi，Pete。How are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.82,1:12:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm good。You said you wanted me to call.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.45,1:12:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did want you to call。I mean，I do want you to call.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.53,1:12:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ask if he can call you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.49,1:13:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to hear from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.62,1:13:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wanted to talk。I like spending time with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.17,1:13:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd like to see more of you，maybe in a continuous block.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.96,1:13:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know。It's just been crazy this week at work.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.84,1:13:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch your back！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.35,1:13:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Use the sleeper.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.52,1:13:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Never send a man to do a woman's job.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.19,1:13:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nice work，Natalie。-Thanks，Bosley.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.36,1:13:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pete？Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.20,1:13:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，under different circumstances…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.83,1:13:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,we'd have made a great couple.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.20,1:13:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，if you hadn't shot me out a window
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.72,1:13:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,and tried to kill everyone I love…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.88,1:13:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,we could have had a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.75,1:13:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you keep a secret？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.71,1:13:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，you can't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.01,1:13:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,That you're disgusting？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.55,1:14:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have the fullest，sweetest…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.06,1:14:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,most luscious…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.90,1:14:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,lips I have ever…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.73,1:14:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,kissed.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.07,1:14:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just gotta take this call.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.24,1:14:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nine o'clock，Charlie。Right on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.37,1:14:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enter。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.22,1:14:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。Bosley's phone，Eric Knox speaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.76,1:14:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr.Knox？This is Charles Townsend.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.06,1:14:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm delighted the Angels helped you。Are you in the office？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.24,1:14:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang up，Charlie。He's almost got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.74,1:15:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're all at the beach，having mimosas.Can you join us？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.45,1:15:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll take a rain check，Eric。Is Bosley there？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.66,1:15:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,He went to the men's room。He'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.25,1:15:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，wait。He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.46,1:15:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bosley？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.14,1:15:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.15,1:15:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's not him。Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.44,1:15:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you hold on one second longer？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.78,1:15:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.12,1:15:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pete？Can you hold on a second？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.37,1:15:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.83,1:15:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like him so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.22,1:15:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Bos.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.43,1:16:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bosley？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.10,1:16:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's coming，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.96,1:16:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，not him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.63,1:16:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can I take a message？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.05,1:16:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just tell him I called，as planned.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.14,1:16:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.00,1:17:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just one more sec.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.63,1:17:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this a bad time？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.67,1:17:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You seem a little distracted.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.51,1:17:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this the famous Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.51,1:17:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，this is Pete.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.73,1:17:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！I like that guy！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.32,1:17:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,That man's got a beautiful telephone voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.33,1:17:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's one more daddy you'll never know.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.75,1:17:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bad news.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.34,1:17:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.92,1:18:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotta go torture and kill your boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.01,1:18:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mikey，Jerry，
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.93,1:18:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,you guys like angel cake？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.11,1:18:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know how hard it is to find a quality man in Los Angeles？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.35,1:18:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't take my lighter.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.99,1:19:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，wait，wait！I have something to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.08,1:19:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,By the time this is over…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.41,1:19:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,all of you will be facedown on the floor…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.75,1:19:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I'll moon-walk out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.50,1:19:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not listening to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.50,1:19:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,First，you're going to help me out of my chair.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.26,1:19:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then I'll leapfrog over you…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.34,1:19:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,before I break his nose.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.10,1:19:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Since my trusty lighter…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.68,1:19:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,isn't working，I'll do all this with my hands tied behind my back.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.52,1:19:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get her！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.37,1:19:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,King Kong palm.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.05,1:20:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Buddha on lotus.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.91,1:20:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,And that's kicking your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.85,1:20:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alex！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.75,1:21:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，Bos！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.16,1:22:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，we'll miss happy hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.45,1:22:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's heading north，just past Paradise Cove！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.49,1:22:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，boy，they found him。That's Charlie's cabin.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.42,1:22:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You've seen it？-You've seen Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.84,1:22:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am his trusted friend and employee.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.84,1:22:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've met Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.59,1:22:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean，「met」？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.26,1:22:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've seen him with your own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.18,1:23:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I saw his hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.77,1:23:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,It could have been anyone's hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.12,1:23:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's see if I can win the teddy bear！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.65,1:24:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.44,1:25:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get Dylan！The missile's making a round trip！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.59,1:25:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dylan！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.31,1:25:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.24,1:26:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.84,1:27:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,You guys，
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.17,1:27:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,we're finally meeting Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.01,1:27:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do I look okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.18,1:27:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Should we knock？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.03,1:27:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.21,1:27:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good morning，Angels.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.22,1:27:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry I couldn't stick around.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.06,1:28:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're so happy you're okay，Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.23,1:28:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm just fine，Angels。Mission accomplished？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.24,1:28:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think the client was blown away.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.91,1:28:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eric Knox was born John McCadden.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.08,1:28:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It seems his life's mission was to bring me down.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.17,1:28:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,His dad was in my Army Intelligence unit，working as a double agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.34,1:28:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,When he was discovered，the other side killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.76,1:28:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess that's not the story Knox heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.76,1:28:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charlie，I've really enjoyed working on this assignment…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.94,1:28:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I eagerly anticipate returning to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.57,1:28:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bosley's had one too many Buddhas.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.28,1:28:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's definitely had a few.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.61,1:28:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a team rebuilding the office.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.28,1:28:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll be better than new when you get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.28,1:28:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.95,1:29:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there any chance you'll be joining us，Charlie？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.13,1:29:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd love to，Angels.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.55,1:29:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I have some precious treasures to watch over.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.97,1:29:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Charlie，it'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.22,1:29:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're drinking from coconuts and Buddhas.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.14,1:29:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,How will we ever know you truly exist…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.23,1:29:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,unless you come have a coconut with us？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.44,1:29:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Faith，Angels。It's called faith.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.87,1:29:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,To Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.29,1:29:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me toast you ladies，with some ice cubes！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.21,1:31:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Safe！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.37,1:31:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to go。I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.71,1:31:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should go。I really should.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.02,1:31:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's see if I can win the teddy bear！
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.09,1:31:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Chad is great.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.93,1:32:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's great。He's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.76,1:32:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Chad is great。He's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.40,1:32:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Chad is great.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.94,1:32:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Chad is stuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.12,1:32:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm having helmet problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.79,1:32:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm having serious helmet problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.47,1:32:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.00,0:06:54.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《霹雳娇娃》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.47,0:00:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说：小姐 座椅没变小
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.80,0:01:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的屁股变大了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.81,0:01:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 先生 这是头等舱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.86,0:01:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要看这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.69,0:01:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,您需要喝点什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.99,0:01:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,威士忌 不加冰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.87,0:02:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位女士先生 我是机长
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.70,0:02:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,前方有乱流
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.87,0:02:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回座并系紧安全带
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,直至系安全带的灯号熄灭为止
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.39,0:02:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说鸟飞不到这个高度
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.73,0:02:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说只有天使能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.41,0:02:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.04,0:02:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 需要我帮你倒酒吗？-不 我直接喝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是旧剧集改编的电影
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.93,0:03:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.23,0:03:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.44,0:03:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.94,0:03:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛？放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 救命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.52,0:03:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命 小心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行愉快吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.41,0:04:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.29,0:05:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说「疯女人」吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.47,0:05:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 我讨厌飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.14,0:05:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？你们是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.65,0:05:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,从前 有三个很不一样的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,长成了三个与众不同的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她蝉连了五天的冠军宝座 干的好 娜妲莉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.03,0:06:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们的共同点是 聪明 美丽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会盯着你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.61,0:06:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你吃足苦头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们也为我效力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.54,0:06:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是查理
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 往这边走 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,往这边
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.56,0:06:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这又不是拔河
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.74,0:06:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 叫我晨曦天使吧 宝贝 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.78,0:07:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 叫我晨曦天使吧 宝贝 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在你走之前 轻抚我脸颊 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 小海星
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 查德
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.60,0:07:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜蜜的查德
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们可以吃点早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.94,0:07:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 也许
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.27,0:07:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以做个小查德
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.03,0:07:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂停一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我马上到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不巧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.46,0:07:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是只会煎蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.46,0:07:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是蛋的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是船的关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.97,0:07:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是船的关系 我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.14,0:08:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是查德的关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.82,0:08:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是查德的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小艾 放音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.58,0:09:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我签过免签收同意书 把东西从洞里塞进来就好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.25,0:09:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.84,0:09:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:09:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说清楚一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.93,0:10:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧 我们之间早无秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意很长
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,又硬又难搞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时越难搞 我就能越快搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你若不能拆除这枚炸弹 洛杉矶就会沉入海底
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.20,0:10:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪跟电线？红的还是蓝的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.04,0:10:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样没用
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.38,0:10:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小松糕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真蠢 我为何不能干脆拉掉电线？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.55,0:10:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,电线只是掩饰 里面才是重点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,触动反馈线路 炸弹就会爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.39,0:10:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为除毛师 你还真懂炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.07,0:11:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,网路能得到的讯息真多 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我何时能见见这个查理？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.59,0:11:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理不喜欢热闹
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.59,0:11:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理是女的 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是女的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法再对杰森掩饰了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.27,0:11:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想要被女强人威胁的男人？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发现我能一头撞破砖头之前 总是很多情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢那招
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝莓小松糕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.95,0:11:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我照食谱做的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来真好吃 艾莉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.46,0:11:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.39,0:12:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国功夫小松糕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.73,0:12:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友被功夫小松糕打中
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果被装成四袋送回老家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.49,0:12:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不是中国人也不会功夫 它们是蓝莓口味的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有秘密身分的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.83,0:12:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不都有吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐过去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天使们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,心脏是肌肉组成的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.51,0:12:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在健身时 我们锻炼肌肉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.22,0:12:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就会变大变壮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,心脏也是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定有颗犀牛般的心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 要引以为傲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.69,0:13:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天使们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些小伤会痊愈的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.53,0:13:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在紧要关头 你的心脏会很强壮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.03,0:13:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将能承接住他的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.37,0:13:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个人都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.21,0:13:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 老波
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我要接个电话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.39,0:13:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 天使们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.05,0:13:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 查理
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.64,0:13:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄纶 艾莉丝 娜妲莉 准备好执行下一个任务了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是艾瑞·诺 天才工程师与诺氏科技创始人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将推出尖端的通讯软体
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.40,0:13:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚 诺被绑架了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.82,0:13:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的语音辨识软体也被窃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女士是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.42,0:14:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,伍·薇安 诺氏科技总裁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她干的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就都可以回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使们 这是伍·薇安 我们的新客户
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她雇请我们去找艾瑞·诺
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺失踪对谁最有利？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是我 我是他的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.44,0:14:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们成为伙伴之前
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.27,0:14:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺有仇家吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.78,0:14:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰·柯 他是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.03,0:14:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上最大的通讯卫星公司「红星」的老板
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个月前 他想买下诺氏科技
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺拒绝出售 姓柯的气坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有要求赎金吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 但我知道他还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我研究录影带 也许有线索
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.14,0:14:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,姓柯的是头号嫌犯 希望他能带我们找到诺
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:15:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,姓柯的每周都会去马杀鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.31,0:15:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们摸他老底的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.98,0:15:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.15,0:15:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他死？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒可以考虑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.49,0:15:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点冷了 阳子 帮我暖暖身子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,悉听尊便
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以在这世纪内开始吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.68,0:15:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,万岁！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.14,0:15:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好爽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你积压太多压力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在第四第五节脊椎里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.61,0:15:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.86,0:15:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看能不能把它
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,纾解掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要活化正确的穴道 就能增进血液循环
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,缓解疼痛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人昏迷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.73,0:16:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 动手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.07,0:16:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,电子记事簿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.45,0:16:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,车钥匙复制好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.79,0:16:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,（下载中）\N行程表到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:17:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的双手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.77,0:17:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以来我旗下做事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.11,0:17:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢抬举 但我的手不想接近你的旗下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是姓柯的是诺绑架案的主谋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.45,0:17:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要有人帮他动手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.80,0:17:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,录影带有何线索？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在强化车窗上反映的影像
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要点些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.98,0:17:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个吉士汉堡 三份薯条 还有三个樱桃派
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要吃什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是其中一个绑匪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:17:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个竹竿怪人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.66,0:18:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们只要找他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.66,0:18:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他是否是姓柯的手下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.66,0:18:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,姓柯的今晚要做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想突袭派对啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,老波
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.69,0:18:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢了 小娜 - 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.69,0:18:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是微波传送器 放在臼齿后
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 这是口内麦克风
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以保持联系
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在从事秘密任务
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们若不记得我叫约翰·戴维 就叫我小戴 就像…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:19:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小呆 - 小待
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.38,0:19:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小黛 - 小袋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.64,0:19:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的对象来了 小戴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪一下 女士们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.07,0:19:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是罗杰·柯 欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.07,0:19:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·大戴 自学导师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.08,0:19:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·大戴？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.33,0:19:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松点 要杯饮料吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.58,0:19:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请给我来杯调酒 - 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.67,0:19:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有看到竹竿怪人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.09,0:19:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多怪人 但都不瘦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想… - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就是没机会… - 没
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.61,0:19:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.28,0:19:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.03,0:20:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.07,0:20:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是日式庭园 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.33,0:20:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是13世纪的神社
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.42,0:20:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是用…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.50,0:20:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是用快递从京都寄过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.34,0:20:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,河豚？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.92,0:20:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是有毒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.51,0:20:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是男人的珍馐 尤其是对那种大无畏的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.51,0:20:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,被毒死的机率有六十分之一
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.03,0:20:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,尝起来很像鸡肉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.86,0:20:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟甘蓝菜煮会很配
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.53,0:20:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人嘲笑死神呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的好 快让他谈谈诺
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.41,0:20:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得尊敬的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.88,0:21:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来测试你的直觉与判断力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小娜 那酒保很可爱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.93,0:21:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在工作
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.52,0:21:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喜欢你 回去再调个情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.19,0:21:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.69,0:21:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫大胆娜妲莉并非浪得虚名
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.70,0:21:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.03,0:21:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看过你在这里工作
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.03,0:21:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是新来的 我就像个处女 这是我第一次…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,来柯氏旗下工作
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.21,0:21:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 她搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.21,0:21:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 他喜欢她
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.38,0:21:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起托盘 走开
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.72,0:21:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不… 留下来跟他说话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.72,0:21:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 甩头发 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.97,0:21:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快甩你的头发
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.07,0:22:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不常如此 但我想…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.25,0:22:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你已有男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.25,0:22:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 当然啰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.46,0:22:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我没有男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.50,0:22:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.26,0:22:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 星期四？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.18,0:22:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.59,0:22:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我去弄票
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.51,0:22:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱死票了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.93,0:22:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣 有人跟娜妲莉约会呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.73,0:22:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,小戴呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.80,0:23:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来个人帮帮我吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.01,0:23:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩们 你们听见了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.81,0:23:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,竹竿人 十点钟方向
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.85,0:24:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么老爱落跑？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.97,0:24:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.74,0:24:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜妲莉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.46,0:25:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 架手桥 - 跳
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.24,0:27:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一一检查
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.71,0:27:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.08,0:27:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.07,0:27:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.57,0:27:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的好 天使们 但任务只完成一半
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.91,0:27:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有诺先生被窃的先进技术
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.12,0:27:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的软体有何特别？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.58,0:27:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它很惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.25,0:28:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发展了一个程式 每个人的声音都很独特
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.93,0:28:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有独特的特性
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.93,0:28:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟雪花一样 它能被描画
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.10,0:28:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是声音的DNA
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.77,0:28:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,它让别人无法假造音纹
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.60,0:28:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以姓柯的才会想要它
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.81,0:28:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 红星的卫星都有 全球定位系统
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.99,0:28:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,若结合了声音辨识
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.78,0:28:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,每只手机都会是自动导引装置
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.78,0:28:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,无人能躲藏
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.45,0:28:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想这要是被误用会有多危险
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.16,0:28:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐私权不再
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.46,0:28:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使们 注意听了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.75,0:28:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,姓柯的赛车队将在赛车场亮相
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.63,0:28:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,藉机去他车上装针孔摄影机
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.93,0:28:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们该加足马力了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.93,0:28:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当柯罗杰首度参与世界赛车时
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.27,0:28:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多人说 我是因性欲减退才来玩车
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.44,0:28:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他们都解雇了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.23,0:29:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好笑的？是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.45,0:29:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢各位参观这次试车
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.50,0:29:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜妲莉
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.67,0:29:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.34,0:29:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能说什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.17,0:29:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是我的红星之日
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.30,0:29:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着回去一如往常无聊的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.89,0:29:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制并奴役世界
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.48,0:29:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.27,0:29:45.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（柯氏必胜）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.37,0:29:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,展现你的魔力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.83,0:29:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面好热
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.17,0:30:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面也好热
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.88,0:30:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我能让你舒服点
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.61,0:30:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拉链没拉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.86,0:30:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,真舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.15,0:30:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.04,0:30:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的设计
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.54,0:30:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的后照镜比较大
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.88,0:30:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱车
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.26,0:30:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢快车吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.73,0:31:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要是快的我都喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.23,0:31:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.95,0:31:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你载我一程
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.57,0:31:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.96,0:31:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务完成
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.35,0:31:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,姓柯的明天会带我们游览红星
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.92,0:31:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊 让我露脸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.34,0:32:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜妲莉
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.63,0:32:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.01,0:32:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑道上有个朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.05,0:32:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个唐人街来的怪人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.84,0:32:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,竹竿怪人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.52,0:32:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是绕圈跑道 他出不去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.26,0:32:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在追他
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.72,0:34:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,针孔摄影机让我们看到红星内部
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.14,0:34:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,主机就在那扇门后
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.31,0:34:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的软体就在那里 但安全措施看起来很严格
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.15,0:34:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 限级进入 - 指纹辨识
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.99,0:34:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,视网膜扫描
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.49,0:34:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使们 说明一下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.82,0:34:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有两位红星董事能进入主机
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.99,0:34:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要进去 他们必须同步进入
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.67,0:34:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,胶状扫描盘读取指纹
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.67,0:34:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,精确度到0.009公厘的雷射光束扫描视网膜
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.51,0:35:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能通过一个受严密监视的真空走廊到达目的地
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.98,0:35:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,要摸进去只有一个办法 隐形起来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.98,0:35:17.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（测量器启动）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.03,0:35:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,地板装有压力感测器
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.57,0:35:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,接触超过0.25秒触发警报
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.75,0:35:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很难
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.04,0:35:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.53,0:35:47.15,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一号董事）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.08,0:36:39.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（二号董事）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.28,0:36:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是性感小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.46,0:36:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们弄错地址了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.83,0:37:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好要整顿他们了？艾莉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.84,0:37:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是艾小姐 我是桃莉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.68,0:37:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉这么混乱
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.22,0:37:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我排定你下周来此 不知怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.27,0:38:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我来此的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.52,0:38:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是效率专家
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.69,0:38:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.69,0:38:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.11,0:38:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱人
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.53,0:38:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.71,0:38:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的方法老旧又无用
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.88,0:38:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的核准程序 确保了只有最基本的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.05,0:38:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,得到奖赏
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.72,0:38:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你们的对手此时却在创新
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.06,0:38:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.73,0:38:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上回做出的建议是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.78,0:38:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,提供免费的可乐贩卖机
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.99,0:38:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.41,0:38:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡因有助我们设计程式
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.75,0:38:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美 聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.58,0:39:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单又符合逻辑
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.92,0:39:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老板怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.09,0:39:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说不行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.59,0:39:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.34,0:39:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,公司产品是谁制造出来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.60,0:39:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.10,0:39:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是工程师
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是经理人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.94,0:39:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们该对你们负责 不是你们对他们负责
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.45,0:39:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁还有跟他类似的建议？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.28,0:39:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.20,0:39:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,更好的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.46,0:39:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,能带我去看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.64,0:40:33.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不准进入）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.64,0:40:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,行不通
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.84,0:41:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,要摸进去只有一个办法 隐形起来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.57,0:41:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,地板装有压力感测器
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.23,0:41:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,接触超过0.25秒 就会触发警报
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.43,0:41:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 先生
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.94,0:42:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不介意我们四处看看
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.64,0:42:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已进入红星主机了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.98,0:42:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知我们能窥伺里面
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.94,0:42:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真行 谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.65,0:42:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要找到红星系统里 有诺氏科技软体的证据
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.78,0:43:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 资料在哪？-在老波的笔记型电脑里
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.37,0:43:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能直接连上红星的主机
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.62,0:43:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,老波？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.83,0:43:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们该自己来分析
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.17,0:43:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞当然是最佳人选
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.67,0:43:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的目标是了解 红星是否窃走你们的软体
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.72,0:43:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们进入它的系统并不道德
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.18,0:43:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到证据就会通知你们
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.47,0:43:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有道理 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.68,0:43:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 小薇？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.85,0:43:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺也许尚未脱离危险呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.98,0:43:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,微笑 别惊动客户
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.15,0:43:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该有人去他家做安检
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.53,0:43:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我同意
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.04,0:43:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切还好吧？- 还好，上面没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.54,0:43:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 好酷
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.72,0:44:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,突击队员是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.05,0:44:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.55,0:44:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片不错
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.06,0:44:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.56,0:44:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们服役于军情单位
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.52,0:44:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人是他的至交 但却出卖他
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.90,0:44:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很难过
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.74,0:44:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.74,0:44:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛留着它？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.58,0:44:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒我要小心朋友 别随便相信别人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.42,0:44:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？你没有父母吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.75,0:44:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你有父母 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.26,0:44:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你母亲呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.59,0:44:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲早年过世 父亲则没见过
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.26,0:44:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没见过他？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.27,0:44:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在为一个
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.44,0:44:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,从未谋面的人工作
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.44,0:44:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣的倾向
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.11,0:45:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,太滑了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.78,0:45:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,想玩拼字游戏吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.45,0:45:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 有人会清理
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.45,0:45:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.45,0:45:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫什么来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.63,0:45:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.47,0:45:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是紧急按钮 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.14,0:45:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,按下它 我们就有人…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.93,0:45:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近的一个 就会来处理状况
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.94,0:45:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样？好 现在就是你了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.48,0:45:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你没出状况啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.82,0:45:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.16,0:45:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.66,0:45:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么烹调鸡肉
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.50,0:45:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拼字游戏？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.96,0:45:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,裹粉鸡？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.33,0:45:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我裹粉 你烹饪？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.85,0:46:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来裹粉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.52,0:46:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 彼得 - 还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.48,0:46:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 你好吗？-很好 很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.53,0:46:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想拿票吗？-好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.37,0:46:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你给我这个机会 - 我想见你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.70,0:46:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的？-是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.37,0:46:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真美 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.83,0:46:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想了很多我们之间的事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.88,0:46:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不… 我知道你有话要说
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.42,0:46:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也有话要说
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.05,0:46:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想我们的事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.22,0:46:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们很疯狂 但我不能自已
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.22,0:46:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.06,0:47:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜寻红星主机内有无诺氏软体
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.40,0:47:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,查无所获
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.24,0:47:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.91,0:47:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.12,0:47:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为儿童募款
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.92,0:47:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 很不错的装扮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.76,0:47:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会在夜晚闪闪发亮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.51,0:47:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你喜欢跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.89,0:47:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧？我最爱跳舞了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.11,0:47:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想上台秀舞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.57,0:47:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们？-好 - 不 女士才能上台
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.28,0:47:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 我在舞池里跳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.62,0:47:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.28,0:47:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是这里最高的荣誉
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.79,0:48:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你不上台 她要上台
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.12,0:48:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？我一直都想上台秀呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.29,0:48:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好秀吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.96,0:48:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我很快就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.63,0:48:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,伍女士 有些界线我从来不跨越
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.97,0:48:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,界线束缚不了我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.31,0:48:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是小姐 叫我小薇
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.81,0:48:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 小薇小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.31,0:48:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,小薇小姐 你是专家
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.15,0:48:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你是个管理专家
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.49,0:48:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要保持专业的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.66,0:48:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以喝吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.16,0:48:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你拿杯子
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.70,0:49:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很棒 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.05,0:49:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 她很棒 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.56,0:49:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的身材可真好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.23,0:49:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 不错
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.45,0:49:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶 机械舞
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.74,0:50:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 白种女孩 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.54,0:50:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是老式舞步吧？没错
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.25,0:50:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是彼得 你们好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.76,0:50:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑步舞 快看
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.93,0:50:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,了不起 真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.39,0:50:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好快乐 真令人兴奋
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.61,0:50:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去化妆室
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.90,0:50:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.45,0:50:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说的是
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.79,0:50:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意嫁给我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.29,0:50:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.29,0:50:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝？天啊 不
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.46,0:50:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 萨老大
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.97,0:50:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 萨老大
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.47,0:51:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.10,0:51:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,太过火了吧？似乎太过火了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.81,0:51:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这镜头太棒了 是全片最棒的部份
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.65,0:51:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.41,0:51:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天还好吧？很好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.49,0:51:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道超级英雄都有秘密身分
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.66,0:51:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不提超级英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.50,0:51:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是动作派演员 我则出生入死
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.51,0:51:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.59,0:51:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 玩得愉快吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.51,0:51:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快乐的要死呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.85,0:51:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是打击犯罪小组的一员
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.60,0:51:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,由不知名的百万富翁所支持
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.19,0:51:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.37,0:52:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.47,0:52:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.84,0:53:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.93,0:53:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.60,0:53:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.19,0:53:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁派你来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.61,0:53:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.78,0:53:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,伍… 伍…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.78,0:53:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？-伍…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.12,0:53:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 薇安 - 说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.12,0:53:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,薇安·伍
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.63,0:53:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.30,0:53:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢火
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.29,0:54:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.33,0:54:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你中枪了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.33,0:54:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 火药包炸开时是有点痛 但我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.67,0:54:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的拖车怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.00,0:54:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没跟你说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.92,0:54:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚在里面？你看看它
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.34,0:54:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是除毛美容师
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.18,0:54:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真糟糕 我是说 那满令人兴奋的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.95,0:54:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.53,0:54:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是查理？-是的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.03,0:54:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了 明天打电话给我？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.12,0:54:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 太好了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.34,0:55:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.21,0:55:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好坏
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.89,0:55:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们终于有点人性了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.89,0:55:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄纶？我是娜妲莉 薇安·伍有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.56,0:55:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她派杀手堵我 快警告诺
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.40,0:55:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就在他家
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.40,0:55:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.65,0:55:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.24,0:55:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知艾莉丝到总部碰头
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.74,0:55:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄纶 该死
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.58,0:55:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别站在窗旁 那不安全
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.26,0:55:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,床单罩袍
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.76,0:55:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我刚发现… 是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.10,0:55:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在做秘密工作啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.27,0:56:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提供全套服务
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.44,0:56:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.27,0:56:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看得出来你没带武器
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.94,0:56:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便谁都能进来 干掉你们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.87,0:56:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,小薇 你想太多了 小薇工作过度不懂情趣
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.12,0:56:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这里是要解决事情 坐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.54,0:56:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,想喝点香槟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.13,0:56:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,「敌人」
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.14,0:56:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.15,0:56:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏消息
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.32,0:56:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友们都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.32,0:56:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而柯呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.60,0:57:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为我们有未来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.68,0:57:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真糟糕 狄纶
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.19,0:57:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在床上很够呛
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.36,0:57:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我直说吧 你是女人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.25,0:57:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人天生有直觉
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.11,0:57:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是个侦探
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.26,0:57:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对这一切都没感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.87,0:57:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就知道 - 她知道
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.20,0:57:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还知道接下来会怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.29,0:57:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她吧 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.88,0:57:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使都是要上天堂的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.38,0:57:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,老波呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.80,0:57:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,留着 我们喜欢他 还有他的电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.80,0:57:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.47,0:58:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,姓柯的跟这一切无关
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.72,0:58:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,无关 但我也没喜欢过他
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.06,0:58:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 整个绑架案是假的 - 恐怕是的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.23,0:58:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,红星的事也是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.98,0:58:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你全都清楚了 还有问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.90,0:58:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.24,0:58:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,问你老板吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.74,0:58:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.91,0:58:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在堵查理
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.83,0:58:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 查理
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.42,0:58:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说在死后
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.30,0:58:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命的问题就会得到答案
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.26,0:58:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会告诉我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.19,0:58:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,去追查理吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.77,0:58:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.87,0:59:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.04,0:59:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？-出事了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.13,0:59:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄纶呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.14,0:59:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说在死后 生命的问题就会得到答案
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.81,0:59:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会告诉我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.01,1:00:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去哪吃饭？薄饼之家？时时乐？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.18,1:00:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真小气
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.70,1:00:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.53,1:00:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 看起来… 棒透了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.96,1:00:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又没看过真的胸部
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.62,1:00:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看过很多胸部 - 没看过
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.21,1:00:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看过很多胸部 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.05,1:00:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮个忙吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.15,1:00:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别问
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.57,1:00:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺呢？他还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.90,1:01:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很好 他是坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.57,1:01:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑架是假的 他是幕后主使
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.83,1:01:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.74,1:01:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把我射出窗外时并没说穿
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.34,1:01:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,老波
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.76,1:01:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很安全 艾瑞·诺抓走他了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.43,1:01:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.60,1:01:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我弄清楚点
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.61,1:01:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,老波跟那个
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.77,1:01:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,想杀我们的人一起 安全吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.11,1:01:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在杀查理前不会杀老波
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.11,1:01:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀查理？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.12,1:01:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.79,1:01:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知他有何计划 但我知道我们能阻止他
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.88,1:02:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果诺认为我们死了 为何要炸掉总部？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.51,1:02:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何要杀查理？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.89,1:02:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾指使我们闯入红星
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.14,1:02:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想这要是被误用会有多危险
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.73,1:02:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺要我们进入红星的主机 不是要拿回他的软体
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.15,1:02:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是要控制全球定位卫星
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.07,1:02:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的软体能辨认查理的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.16,1:02:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,并运用红星的卫星找到他
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.08,1:02:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但诺为什么要堵查理？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.67,1:02:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.17,1:02:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们服役于军情单位
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.92,1:02:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的至交出卖了他
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.59,1:02:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺以为查理杀了他父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.85,1:02:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他能拦截查理的电话
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.68,1:02:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能找到他
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.43,1:02:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他得先让查理打电话
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.85,1:03:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查理只会打给一个人… - 老波
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.72,1:03:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我来杯冰水吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.24,1:03:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞向我吧 天使们 快来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.25,1:03:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,请飞向我吧 天使们
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.08,1:04:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾跟只松鼠聊过很久的天
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.67,1:04:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没跟人说过那么多话呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.28,1:04:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？有人吗？外面有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.95,1:04:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,老波的电脑呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.79,1:04:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是他们拿走了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.46,1:04:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去艾瑞·诺家查查 - 走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.21,1:04:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开车
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.46,1:04:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使们？天使们 救我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.96,1:04:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,老波？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.30,1:04:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使们
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.88,1:04:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的广播节目开始了 来找我吧 天使们
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.64,1:04:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你们听得到我的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.31,1:05:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就设法
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.14,1:05:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这里来救我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.23,1:05:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有办法找到他吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.65,1:05:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使有设备 他也要在二十英里内才行
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.99,1:05:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所在的地方 很像雪儿的房间
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.32,1:05:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还臭气熏天
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.16,1:05:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.16,1:05:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,空气中有海的味道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.16,1:05:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,从窗户看出去 就能看到海
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.75,1:05:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国西北沿海都有可能
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.50,1:05:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.17,1:05:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们我在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.68,1:05:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.76,1:05:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是侏儒西塔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.85,1:05:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种侏儒雀
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.52,1:05:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上只有一个地方看得见
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.52,1:05:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡蜜尔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.11,1:05:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没其他的好说了 除了…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.19,1:05:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我的生命所剩不多
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.20,1:05:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是我剩下生命不多了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.20,1:06:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到一个灯塔 两间旅馆 七座庄园
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.54,1:06:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一座属于国家公园 一座属于瑞诺艾公司
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.88,1:06:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是艾还是爱？-艾
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.38,1:06:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个字谜
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.26,1:06:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,重组后就是艾瑞·诺
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.55,1:06:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,拼字游戏狂
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.30,1:06:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个旧地道通往海岸边
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.89,1:06:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,由海路过去不会被察觉 我们需要一艘船
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.39,1:06:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了要有掩护 不能开快艇
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.07,1:06:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,去码头吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.46,1:07:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意能快一点吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.63,1:07:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在赶时间 如果你让我开的话 我会开快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.63,1:07:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这艘爱之船只有一位船长
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.47,1:07:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长就是我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.81,1:07:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,查德
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.81,1:07:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,查德
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.48,1:07:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,查德 爱之船的船长
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.56,1:07:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,查德
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.81,1:07:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在赶时间
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.98,1:07:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是查德
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.42,1:08:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺氏语音辨识软体下载成功
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.51,1:08:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,红星卫星网路连结成功
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.69,1:08:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,报仇真好玩
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.16,1:08:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说 小海星 我很荣幸
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.87,1:08:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我的工作有兴趣
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.14,1:08:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我觉得你很漂亮小海星
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.04,1:08:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小海星？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.04,1:08:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.88,1:08:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,小海星 你要去游泳吗？你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.42,1:08:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这次又要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.13,1:09:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,小海星？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.80,1:09:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是查德的关系吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.89,1:09:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 查德很棒
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.77,1:09:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,查德很棒
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.73,1:09:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去屋顶拦截讯号
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.15,1:10:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我对付诺 - 我去救老波
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.80,1:10:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我不会烹调鸡肉」
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.34,1:10:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,浑球
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.01,1:11:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄纶
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.51,1:11:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝你还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.30,1:11:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认得我的另一半
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.60,1:11:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老是遇到这种完美对象 是早就有完美伴侣的人
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.59,1:11:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 金发小妞
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.59,1:11:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的朋友都来了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.43,1:11:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿吉 大力 去看住老波
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.26,1:11:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是现在 快 快
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.44,1:12:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,老波？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.27,1:12:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老波？-娜妲莉？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.11,1:12:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜妲莉 是你吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.32,1:12:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这门后面
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.78,1:12:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,老波 我好高兴看到你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.62,1:12:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都来了 我救你出来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.30,1:12:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,红的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.30,1:12:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.30,1:12:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭上卫星定位系统了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.47,1:12:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,侏儒雀
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.31,1:12:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我好痒 - 谁打来的？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.94,1:12:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是彼得 - 彼得？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.82,1:12:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.48,1:12:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.82,1:12:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 你说过要我打电话的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.45,1:12:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说过 我是认真的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.53,1:12:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他等会再打
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.49,1:13:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好高兴你打来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.62,1:13:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟你说话 我想跟你在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.17,1:13:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢跟你在一起 我想跟你相处更久一点
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.96,1:13:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我这星期工作太忙了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.84,1:13:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心背后
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.35,1:13:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,赏他一腿
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.52,1:13:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,男人办事就是不牢靠
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.19,1:13:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做的好 娜妲莉 - 谢了 老波
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.36,1:13:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得？嗨
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.20,1:13:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,换个时空
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.83,1:13:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会很速配的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.20,1:13:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 若你没对我开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.72,1:13:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,又试图去杀我所爱的人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.88,1:13:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能还有机会
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.75,1:13:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能保守秘密吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.71,1:13:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不告诉任何人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.01,1:13:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,说你很恶心吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.55,1:14:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拥有一双我所吻过
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.06,1:14:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,最饱满甜蜜
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.90,1:14:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,最迷人的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.73,1:14:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘴唇
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.07,1:14:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得接这通电话
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.24,1:14:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,九点整 查理 真准时
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.37,1:14:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,输入 快啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.22,1:14:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是老波的电话 我是艾瑞·诺
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.76,1:14:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺先生？我是查理汤森
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.06,1:14:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴天使们帮上了忙 你在办公室吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.24,1:14:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,挂断 查理 他快找到你了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.74,1:15:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都在海边喝香槟呢 你能加入我们吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.45,1:15:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,改天吧 老波在吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.66,1:15:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去上洗手间 马上回来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.25,1:15:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 他来了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.46,1:15:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,老波？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.14,1:15:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 开始吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.15,1:15:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是他 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.44,1:15:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能再等一等吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.78,1:15:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.12,1:15:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得？你稍能等一下吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.37,1:15:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.83,1:15:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好喜欢他
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.22,1:15:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,老波
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.43,1:16:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,老波
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.10,1:16:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.96,1:16:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 不是他
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.63,1:16:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要留话吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.05,1:16:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他说我打过电话来了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.14,1:16:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮到你了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.00,1:17:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.63,1:17:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是不方便？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.67,1:17:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你似乎有点分心
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.51,1:17:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是有名的查理吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.51,1:17:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是彼得
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.73,1:17:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢他呢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.32,1:17:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人的声音很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.33,1:17:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是另一个你永远不会认识的爹地了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.75,1:17:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏消息
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.34,1:17:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.92,1:18:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去折磨并杀死你老板
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.01,1:18:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,老麦 小杰
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.93,1:18:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吃天使蛋糕吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.11,1:18:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道在洛杉矶 好男人有多难找？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.35,1:18:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我的打火机
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.99,1:19:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等… 我有话要说
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.08,1:19:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,等这一切结束时
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.41,1:19:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都将倒卧地上
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.75,1:19:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我则会跳着舞离去
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.50,1:19:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.50,1:19:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 你要帮我离开椅子
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.26,1:19:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着 在我打断他鼻梁前
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.34,1:19:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会跳过你
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.10,1:19:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于我可靠的打火机
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.68,1:19:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,故障了 我只好 绑着双手行动了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.52,1:19:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住她
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.37,1:19:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,金刚掌
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.05,1:20:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛祖坐莲
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.91,1:20:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那招是让你满地找牙
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.85,1:20:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.75,1:21:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 老波
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.16,1:22:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 别错过好戏了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.45,1:22:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他往北走 就在天堂湾那边
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.49,1:22:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找到了 那是查理的木屋
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.42,1:22:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看过？-你看过查理？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.84,1:22:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他朋友兼员工
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.84,1:22:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过查理？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.59,1:22:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫「见过」？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.26,1:22:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你亲眼看过他？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.18,1:23:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过他的手
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.77,1:23:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可能是任何人的手
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.12,1:23:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我能不能正中红心
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.65,1:24:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 查理
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.44,1:25:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,去叫狄纶 飞弹往回飞
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.59,1:25:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄纶
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.31,1:25:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.24,1:26:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.84,1:27:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.17,1:27:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们终于要见到查理了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.01,1:27:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看起来还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.18,1:27:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,该敲门吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.03,1:27:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.21,1:27:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 天使们
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.22,1:27:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我没能留在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.06,1:28:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很高兴你没事
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.23,1:28:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 天使们 任务完成了？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.24,1:28:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这客户是完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.91,1:28:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞·诺原名叫约翰·麦
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.08,1:28:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他似乎一心只想毁了我
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.17,1:28:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他父亲们隶属于我的军情单位 他是个双面谍
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.34,1:28:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,身分暴露后 他被敌方杀了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.76,1:28:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜诺听到的不是这个版本
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.76,1:28:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,查理 我很高兴能参与这任务
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.94,1:28:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很渴望回去工作
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.57,1:28:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,老波喝太多酒了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.28,1:28:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的喝了不少
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.61,1:28:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已请人重建总部
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.28,1:28:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们回去时 那里会焕然一新
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.28,1:28:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 查理
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.95,1:29:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有可能加入我们吗 查理？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.13,1:29:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意 天使们
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.55,1:29:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我更喜欢从远处凝望
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.97,1:29:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,来嘛 查理 很好玩的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.22,1:29:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在喝椰子和佛祖酒呢
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.14,1:29:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道你真的存在
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.23,1:29:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你跟我们一起喝椰子酒
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.44,1:29:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,信念 天使们 就是信念
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.87,1:29:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬查理
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.29,1:29:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用冰块敬你们吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.21,1:31:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全上垒
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.37,1:31:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了 很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.71,1:31:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该走了 真的该走了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.02,1:31:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我能不能正中红心
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.09,1:31:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,查德很棒
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.93,1:32:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很棒 他很棒
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.76,1:32:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,查德很棒 他很棒
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.40,1:32:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,查德棒呆了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.94,1:32:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,查德卡住了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.12,1:32:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的钢盔有问题
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.79,1:32:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的钢盔问题很严重
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.47,1:32:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好耶
